<description>F0 gate. Every automated outbound email to a Lead or Contact calls this subflow before sending. Blocks: Do Not Contact, HasOptedOutOfEmail or consent Opted Out, bounced email, no email, marketing send without AK9I_Consent_Status__c = Consent Confirmed, and unsolicited sends over the cap (AK9I_Pipeline_Setting__mdt.Default: 2 per 30 days, from the README guardrail). Solicited sends skip the cap. Logs every Allowed/Blocked decision to AK9I_Outreach_Log__c. Outputs outCanSend and outReason. Logs Allowed before the caller sends.</description>
<environments>Default</environments>
<formulas><name>fLeadBounced</name><dataType>Boolean</dataType><expression>NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Lead.EmailBouncedDate}))</expression></formulas>
<formulas><name>fCap</name><dataType>Number</dataType><expression>BLANKVALUE({!Get_Setting.Unsolicited_Cap_30_Day__c},2)</expression><scale>0</scale></formulas>
<formulas><name>fWindowStart</name><dataType>DateTime</dataType><expression>{!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - BLANKVALUE({!Get_Setting.Cap_Window_Days__c},30)</expression></formulas>
<formulas><name>fSolicited</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>IF({!inIsSolicited},&quot;Solicited&quot;,&quot;Unsolicited&quot;)</expression></formulas>
<formulas><name>fTemplate</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>LEFT({!inTemplateName},255)</expression></formulas>
<formulas><name>fOutcome</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>LEFT(IF({!outCanSend},&quot;Allowed&quot;,&quot;Blocked: &quot;&amp;{!outReason}),255)</expression></formulas>
<formulas><name>fReasonLogFailed</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>{!outReason}&amp;&quot; (log write failed)&quot;</expression></formulas>
